+| # | Commit | Fix | Tests |
+|---|--------|-----|-------|
+| S-2 (residual) | `a220eb1` | `server/pipeline.js#pauseError` refuses a paused company before its first request (code `paused`), for every source. Callers: `fetchLive`, `scripts/snapshot.js one()` and the probe's full mode. The probe counts `www.google.com`, the Google adapter's origin, as Google's careers host, so raw mode refuses it while Google is paused | "S-2 residual" (every built-in with an adapter) and the three 2026-10-11 S-2 tests, now run with `paused` set on the registry entries |
